<view class="service-page">
  <view class="top-nav" style="padding-top: {{navTopPadding}}px;">
    <text bindtap="goBack">〈</text>
    <text class="title">产品详情</text>
    <text>•••</text>
  </view>

  <image class="banner" src="{{service.banner}}" mode="aspectFill"></image>

  <view class="title-card">
    <text class="name">{{service.title}}</text>
    <view class="option-card">
      <text class="option-name">{{service.subTitle}}</text>
      <text class="option-price">{{service.price}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="guarantee">
    <text class="label">保障</text>
    <text wx:for="{{service.tags}}" wx:key="*this">✔ {{item}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="spec-card">
    <view class="head">
      <text>服务规格</text>
      <text>查看全部 〉</text>
    </view>
    <view class="spec-list">
      <text wx:for="{{specs}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="desc-card">
    <text class="section-title">服务内容</text>
    <text class="desc">{{descText}}</text>
    <image wx:for="{{detailImages}}" wx:key="*this" src="{{item}}" mode="widthFix"></image>
  </view>

  <view class="notice-card">
    <text class="section-title">订购须知</text>
    <text>1、请提前预约；2、超时服务可能产生额外费用；3、特殊情况可协商取消。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="comment-card">
    <view class="head">
      <text>用户评论</text>
      <text>0条评论 〉</text>
    </view>
    <text class="empty">暂无评论</text>
  </view>

  <view class="bottom-bar">
    <text class="consult">在线咨询</text>
    <view class="buy-btn" bindtap="orderConfrim">立即购买</view>
  </view>
</view>
